2. Review the Google Earth Engine scripts for Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, and forest-boundary processing.
3. Review the workflow documentation.
4. Review the code index.
5. Inspect the scripts relevant to the manuscript section of interest.
6. Reconstruct the software environment using requirements.txt or environment.example.yml.
7. Adapt local paths, Google Earth Engine assets, and required datasets before executing individual scripts.
